Copyright (c) 2026 Zawardo (https://github.com/Zawardo1000). All rights reserved.

This source code is published only so that anyone can read and understand it and verify the reliability of the
evidence Timbro produces. It is neither free nor open source software.

You may, without asking: (1) read and study the code; (2) build and run it solely to verify that it does what is
stated, e.g. to compare the app built from these sources with an installed one, or a release with its sources;
(3) run timbro/verifica_pacchetto.py (verifica.py in evidence packages) to verify evidence packages produced by
Timbro; (4) quote short excerpts in expert reports, legal documents or opinions assessing Timbro evidence.

Without the owner's written permission you may not, in whole or in part, not even fragments: reuse the code in
other programs or projects, commercial or not; modify it in order to use, distribute, republish or make it
available to others (except what the hosting site's terms allow on the site itself, e.g. viewing or forking);
use it to provide a service to third parties, even free of charge; use it to train artificial intelligence models.

Third-party files (fonts under the SIL Open Font License, public certificates of Google and of the time-stamping
providers, the EU Trusted List, test data taken from third-party projects) remain under their own licences.

The code is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind; the owner is not liable for any damages arising from
its use.
